  "packageHash": "e6KSNuB1vGgbZGOkV8rFqve8aSerwm16idSk3kcMZnBRRKpJD/QmOM31cnhiMQlaWNZ5QPhctrmfrq/KL+1PHA==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 360903,
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/art-ix/picturesharp.jxl",
  "published": "2026-11-02T08:13:20.717Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.8.10: layered images decode. Frames that are cropped (at any offset) or blended with Replace, Add, Blend, AlphaWeightedAdd or Mul are composited into one image as djxl does by default; lossless layers match djxl exactly. With ColorConversion = ToSrgb a blended XYB image is converted to sRGB in floating point. Single-frame images decode exactly as in 0.8.9. No API changes. See docs/releases/release-0.8.10.md and docs/design/0.8.10-blending.md.",
